{"category_edits":[{"category":"learning_objective","rationale":"Blend 90% of the existing negative-score-weighted pairwise loss with 10% uniform pairwise loss. This gives every valid training pair direct ranking supervision while preserving sampling, architecture, scoring, optimizer, and training settings.","edits":[{"find":"    pairwise_loss = torch.nn.functional.softplus(valid_neg - valid_pos)
    return (weights * pairwise_loss).sum()","replace":"    pairwise_loss = torch.nn.functional.softplus(valid_neg - valid_pos)
    existing_loss = (weights * pairwise_loss).sum()
    return 0.9 * existing_loss + 0.1 * pairwise_loss.mean()"}]}],"change_summary":"Change only the learning objective to a 90/10 weighted/uniform pairwise-loss blend using existing scores. Predictor and checkpoint formats remain compatible."}
